// Codejock renamed Report Control to Grid Control at 22.0.0. The class bodies
// that used to live here are identical to cSigCJGridFieldChooser.pkg apart from
// which wrapper they Use, and all three copies declare the same class names, so
// this file now dispatches instead of declaring - the same shape upstream gave
// cSigCJReportControl.pkg and cSigCJReportControlContextMenu.pkg.

Use SigCjLicense.pkg

#IF (SigCj_Codejock_Version < 220000)
    Use cSigCJReportFieldChooser_Pre2200.pkg
#ELSE
    Use cSigCJGridFieldChooser.pkg
#ENDIF

